MEMORY_UPDATE/v1

project: MINDROCK-PROJECT-OFFICE / CEOFFICE
related_memory: 159
type: STATE_FRAME_AND_ATTENTION_SURFACE
execution_authorized: false

Pasha's target is a single-screen, portrait-phone CEO instrument rather than a task-list dashboard. The same organization state has two projections:

1. CAPTAIN_VIEW — a 3D synthetic horizon, approximately 60/40 sky/water, where the horizon represents organizational buoyancy. Phone gyroscope may affect presentation, never data or decisions.
2. MAP_VIEW — top-down NW/NE/SE/SW projection of the four business/resource quadrants.

Canonical coordinates:
- depth/distance from Pasha = marginal value and necessity of CEO attention;
- distance toward the central Important/Non-critical axis = strategic importance;
- height relative to horizon = buoyancy/reserve/autonomous continuation capacity;
- color = mechanically derived status, never LLM mood.

Center-screen admission invariant:
`ExpectedValue(PashaDecision) > ExpectedValue(AutonomousContinuation)`.
Only a causally compressed, evidence-backed decision request may enter the center.

RED_BUDGET/v1:
Many correlated red leaves must be compressed to the cheapest causal parent before human notification. Example:
`Darwin unavailable + Wolfram unavailable + router timeouts + telemetry absent -> probable apartment power/network domain -> one CHECK_POWER request`.
Candidate KPI:
`Escalation Compression Ratio = raw anomalies / human interruptions`, paired with false-suppression rate so compression cannot hide real incidents.

STATE_FRAME/v1 minimum sensors:
- org/portfolio/project/gate health;
- active role/task leases and exact evidence freshness;
- provider/model quota observations with observed/inferred/unknown labels;
- host utilization and backlog coverage;
- SLA/budget variance;
- causal incident clusters;
- unresolved sovereign attention requests;
- imaginary capitalization plus confidence/provenance.

Imaginary capitalization is an internal strategic/option metric, not statutory valuation or investor return. Keep terminal-value assumptions, discount convention, confidence and acceleration separate. Public LP projection, if ever authorized, must be delayed/redacted and Compliance-reviewed; this memory grants no publication authority.

Hourly Market/CEO summaries should eventually attach one machine-generated State Frame and narrate only material deltas. No executable dashboard successor is authorized by this update.
